    "dispatcher": "Call mpn_mul_basecase directly for every length; do not apply tuned Toom/FFT thresholds",
    "input": "Two nonnegative integers in padded little-endian 64-bit limb vectors, longer first; distinct output vector",
    "arbitrary_n": "m=max(1,ceil(n_a/64)), k=max(1,ceil(n_b/64)); swap lengths if needed; zero allowed; fixed-width 64(m+k)-bit output retains high zero limbs"
